/* Clients page actions. Every change is written to ServiceM8 (the master); the hub table only keeps each contact's role.
   a=client_save (company fields + accounts contact = primary BILLING contact), a=client_new, a=contact_add, a=contact_save, a=remove.
   Only fields that are sent are written, so a missing field never blanks something set in ServiceM8. Payment terms are never written (ServiceM8 accepts only its own fixed values; set them in ServiceM8).
   Output: one item per ServiceM8 call {method,url,body,hub}; CA After pairs results with these items by position. */
const S=v=>v==null?'':String(v).trim();
